        "id": 125077,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-03T06:39:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The heroes roles in this puzzle are very similar to their roles in the actual game. &nbsp;Wraith is needed for a few choice utilities, Legacy for damage boosting, the Visionary for villian control and Twist the Aether, and Absolute Zero is for crazy comboing for ridiculous damage.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The key here is understanding how ridiculous AZ can be with Twist the Aether and coolant blast. &nbsp;Once you've wrapped your head around that, it's mostly a matter of fueling his shenanigans as much as possible without killing anyone, and juggling the numbers to maximize his effects.</p><p>Getting all the fuel sources for the combo nessesary to deal 80+ damage requires some creative juggling. &nbsp;If you need help with that, go back up to Humble-Knight's hints.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
